     "text": [
      "=== Source 1 (双簇重建, N=245,419) ===\n",
      "  θ_out median=47.7° | θ_geo median=47.8°\n",
      "  |θ_geo-θ_out|: mean=3.0°, median=0.0°\n",
      "  相关系数 corr=0.910\n",
      "=== Source 2 (双簇重建, N=372,250) ===\n",
      "  θ_out median=47.5° | θ_geo median=47.6°\n",
      "  |θ_geo-θ_out|: mean=2.9°, median=0.0°\n",
